# Semgrep is a SAST tool for source code. Skip everything that isn't source —
# documentation, design assets, binaries, build artifacts, lockfiles.
#
# Without this file Semgrep walks every tracked path, hits binary content
# (EPS/PDF/PNG) with regex-based secret rules, matches base64 noise as
# "detected-private-key" / "detected-github-token", and times out the job.
#
# Dependency-level security is Dependabot's job, not Semgrep's — lockfiles
# and manifest diffs belong to Dependabot alerts + version policy, so we
# exclude package-lock.json here.

# Documentation & reference assets
project-documentation/
docs/

# Design binaries (catch-all in case they move out of project-documentation)
*.pdf
*.eps
*.ai
*.psd
*.indd
*.sketch
*.fig
*.xd

